## Original Content
Colombia faces years of rebuilding after earthquake devastation

## Summary
Colombia has been devastated by an earthquake, leading to widespread destruction. The country will require years of rebuilding and recovery efforts to address the damage.

## Key Points
- An earthquake has caused significant destruction in Colombia
- Rebuilding efforts are expected to take several years
- The disaster will have long-term impacts on the affected regions


